per-target language-mode setting. Reported rather than assumed, because the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"difference is invisible from the outside and decides whether the concurrency","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"guarantees were checked or merely intended.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This reads the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"language mode","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", not the toolchain: "},{"code":"#if swift(>=6.0)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" tests the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"former and "},{"code":"#if compiler(>=6.0)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" the latter, and they genuinely differ in this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"package. On a 6.x toolchain the library and the examples are built in Swift 6"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mode while the test target is deliberately still built in Swift 5 mode — the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"library and examples compile clean under full strict-concurrency checking and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"test harness does not, so scoping the mode to the targets that actually ship is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what makes the guarantee about the artifact you get rather than about a rewrite of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the test suite."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/SupportedVersions/isSwiftSixLanguageMode":{"abstract":[{"text":"Whether ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"this library","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" was compiled in Swift 6 language mode.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions\/isSwiftSixLanguageMode","title":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode","fragments":[{"